Practical-class PDFs for the 2026/2027 academic year.

Name them practical-class-01.pdf, practical-class-02.pdf, … so they sort
naturally and match the 2025-2026-classes/ convention. This folder is listed
under `resources:` in _quarto.yml, so anything dropped here is copied to
docs/2026-2027-classes/ on the next render.

See _TEACHING-MAINTENANCE.md for the full drop-in checklist.
